{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"b06b4bb56cb35ae6c8ccf3dd2adb925da712d6c84371ff823d13c56a992c8290","digest":{"component_or_area":".gitignore configuration","key_entities":[".gitignore",".provision.log","com.navapbc.rebar-worktree-gc",".venv/","__pycache__/",".pytest_cache/",".ruff_cache/"],"problem_keywords":["gitignore","provisioning artifact","worktree gc","untracked file","git status"],"propositions":[".provision.log is written during venv provisioning but not gitignored, causing git status to report it as untracked","Untracked .provision.log prevents worktree garbage collection because the GC safety guard refuses to reclaim worktrees with dirty status","Adding .provision.log to .gitignore alongside other provisioning artifacts (.venv/, __pycache__/, etc.) makes git ignore the file at any directory depth",".provision.log is build/provisioning noise never read after provisioning and never intended to be committed"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787575349258542001,"uuid":"632d2ed4-352b-4517-9f31-592d4730516e"}